,"dispersionType":"Standard Deviation","unitOfMeasure":"percentage of the total cell population","timeFrame":"Baseline, Day 28, and Day 84","groups":[{"id":"OG000","title":"Danicopan","description":"Participants received danicopan 100 to 200 mg TID."}],"denoms":[{"units":"Participants","counts":[{"groupId":"OG000","value":"10"}]}],"classes":[{"title":"Baseline","denoms":[{"units":"Participants","counts":[{"groupId":"OG000","value":"10"}]}],"categories":[{"measurements":[{"groupId":"OG000","value":"31.5363","spread":"24.62004"}]}]},{"title":"Day 28","denoms":[{"units":"Participants","counts":[{"groupId":"OG000","value":"9"}]}],"categories":[{"measurements":[{"groupId":"OG000","value":"43.6279","spread":"15.58021"}]}]},{"title":"Day 84","denoms":[{"units":"Participants","counts":[{"groupId":"OG000","value":"8"}]}],"categories":[{"measurements":[{"groupId":"OG000","value":"56.2953","spread":"19.85086"}]}]}]},{"type":"SECONDARY","title":"Serious Adverse Events (SAEs), Grade 3 And Grade 4 Treatment-emergent Adverse Events (TEAEs), And Adverse Events (AEs) Leading To Discontinuation","description":"An AE was as any untoward medical occurrence associated with the use of a drug in humans, whether or not considered drug related. An SAE was an AE that met at least 1 of the following criteria: resulted in death, was life-threatening, required inpatient hospitalization or prolongation of existing hospitalization for the AE, persistent or significant disability/incapacity or substantial disruption of the ability to conduct normal life functions, congenital anomaly/birth defect (in the child of a participant who was exposed to the study drug), important medical event or reaction. The intensity of an AE was graded according to the Common Terminology Criteria for Adverse Events (CTCAE) Adverse Event Severity Grading Table. A summary of SAEs and other non-serious AEs regardless of causality is located in the Reported Adverse Events module.","populationDescription":"All participants who received at least 1 dose of study drug.","reportingStatus":"POSTED","paramType":"COUNT_OF_PARTICIPANTS","unitOfMeasure":"Participants","timeFrame":"After the first dose of study medication (Day 1) through 14 days after the last dose of study drug (up to Day 104)","groups":[{"id":"OG000","title":"Danicopan","description":"Participants received danicopan 100 to 200 mg TID."}],"denoms":[{"units":"Participants","counts":[{"groupId":"OG000","value":"10"}]}],"classes":[{"title":"SAE","categories":[{"measurements":[{"groupId":"OG000","value":"1"}]}]},{"title":"TEAE Grade 3","categories":[{"measurements":[{"groupId":"OG000","value":"1"}]}]},{"title":"TEAE Grade 4","categories":[{"measurements":[{"groupId":"OG000","value":"1"}]}]},{"title":"AE leading to discontinuation","categories":[{"measurements":[{"groupId":"OG000","value":"1"}]}]}]},{"type":"SECONDARY","title":"Grade 3 And Grade 4 Laboratory Abnormalities","description":"Laboratory abnormalities were determined from laboratory measurements analyzed at the central or local laboratories, and were graded using CTCAE.","populationDescription":"All participants who received at least 1 dose of study drug.","reportingStatus":"POSTED","paramType":"COUNT_OF_PARTICIPANTS","unitOfMeasure":"Participants","timeFrame":"After the first dose of study medication (Day 1) through 14 days after the last dose of study drug (up to Day 104).","groups":[{"id":"OG000","title":"Danicopan","description":"Participants received danicopan 100 to 200 mg TID."}],"denoms":[{"units":"Participants","counts":[{"groupId":"OG000","value":"10"}]}],"classes":[{"title":"Alanine aminotransferase increased","categories":[{"measurements":[{"groupId":"OG000","value":"1"}]}]},{"title":"Aspartate aminotransferase increased","categories":[{"measurements":[{"groupId":"OG000","value":"1"}]}]},{"title":"Low hemoglobin","categories":[{"measurements":[{"groupId":"OG000","value":"1"}]}]},{"title":"Low neutrophil count","categories":[{"measurements":[{"groupId":"OG000","value":"4"}]}]},{"title":"High triglycerides","categories":[{"measurements":[{"groupId":"OG000","value":"1"}]}]}]},{"type":"SECONDARY","title":"Pharmacokinetics (PK): Area Under The Plasma Concentration-time Curve From Time Of Administration To 8 Hours Post-dose (AUC0-8)","description":"Serial blood samples were collected predose and up to 8 hours postdose.","populationDescription":"All participants who received at least 1 dose of study drug and had analyzable data at the timepoints specified. PK analysis was not conducted on the 200 mg dose.","reportingStatus":"POSTED","paramType":"GEOMETRIC_MEAN","dispersionType":"Geometric Coefficient of Variation","unitOfMeasure":"hour (hr)*nanograms/milliliter (ng/mL)","timeFrame":"Days 6 and 20","groups":[{"id":"OG000","title":"Danicopan","description":"Participants received danicopan 100 to 200 mg TID."}],"denoms":[{"units":"Participants","counts":[{"groupId":"OG000","value":"10"}]}],"classes":[{"title":"Day 6: 100 mg TID","denoms":[{"units":"Participants","counts":[{"groupId":"OG000","value":"2"}]}],"categories":[{"measurements":[{"groupId":"OG000","value":"1432.611","spread":"19.41"}]}]},{"title":"Day 20: 150 mg TID","denoms":[{"units":"Participants","counts":[{"groupId":"OG000","value":"4"}]}],"categories":[{"measurements":[{"groupId":"OG000","value":"2370.421","spread":"14.92"}]}]},{"title":"Day 20: 175 mg TID","denoms":[{"units":"Participants","counts":[{"groupId":"OG000","value":"6"}]}],"categories":[{"measurements":[{"groupId":"OG000","value":"2278.038","spread":"37.30"}]}]}]},{"type":"SECONDARY","title":"PK: Maximum Plasma Concentration (Cmax)","description":"Serial blood samples were collected predose and up to 12 hours postdose.","populationDescription":"All participants who received at least 1 dose of study drug and had analyzable data at the timepoints specified. PK analysis was not conducted on the 200 mg dose.","reportingStatus":"POSTED","paramType":"GEOMETRIC_MEAN","dispersionType":"Geometric Coefficient of Variation","unitOfMeasure":"ng/mL","timeFrame":"Days 6 and 20","groups":[{"id":"OG000","title":"Danicopan","description":"Participants received danicopan 100 to 200 mg TID."}],"denoms":[{"units":"Participants","counts":[{"groupId":"OG000","value":"10"}]}],"classes":[{"title":"Day 6: 100 mg TID","denoms":[{"units":"Participants","counts":[{"groupId":"OG000","value":"2"}]}],"categories":[{"measurements":[{"groupId":"OG000","value":"347.707","spread":"9.57"}]}]},{"title":"Day 20: 150 mg TID","denoms":[{"units":"Participants","counts":[{"groupId":"OG000","value":"4"}]}],"categories":[{"measurements":[{"groupId":"OG000","value":"583.626","spread":"27.29"}]}]},{"title":"Day 20: 175 mg TID","denoms":[{"units":"Participants","counts":[{"groupId":"OG000","value":"6"}]}],"categories":[{"measurements":[{"groupId":"OG000","value":"516.8788","spread":"33.39"}]}]}]},{"type":"SECONDARY","title":"PK: Time To Maximum Concentration (Tmax)","description":"Serial blood samples were collected predose and up to 12 hours postdose.","populationDescription":"All participants who received at least 1 dose of study drug and had analyzable data at the timepoints specified. PK analysis was not conducted on the 200 mg dose.","reportingStatus":"POSTED","paramType":"MEDIAN","dispersionType":"Full Range","unitOfMeasure":"hr","timeFrame":"Days 6 and 20","groups":[{"id":"OG000","title":"Danicopan","description":"Participants who received danicopan 100 to 200 mg TID."}],"denoms":[{"units":"Participants","counts":[{"groupId":"OG000","value":"10"}]}],"classes":[{"title":"Day 6: 100 mg TID","denoms":[{"units":"Participants","counts":[{"groupId":"OG000","value":"2"}]}],"categories":[{"measurements":[{"groupId":"OG000","value":"4.17","lowerLimit":"3.67","upperLimit":"4.67"}]}]},{"title":"Day 20: 150 mg TID","denoms":[{"units":"Participants","counts":[{"groupId":"OG000","value":"4"}]}],"categories":[{"measurements":[{"groupId":"OG000","value":"3.67","lowerLimit":"1.05","upperLimit":"4.67"}]}]},{"title":"Day 2